"road_text": "Description: Production to Pad Date: November 12 12:00 PM to November 12 4:00 PM",
"order": "Order No. 2026-25 Pursuant to Mayor's Order No. 2026-25, issued by Mayor Bobby Peden and attested by City Clerk Keila Tuttle, under authority granted by Texas Space Commission Order No. 2025-02, Ordinance No. 2026-2, and the City's Emergency Management Plan, the City of Starbase is temporarily closing Boca Chica Beach, Texas State Highway 4 (from FM 1419/Oklahoma Ave. to the beach entrance), and associated FAA hazard areas/Clear Zone to protect public health and safety during SpaceX spaceflight activities on Friday, November 13, 2026 and Saturday, November 14, 2026, from 11:00 a.m. to 11:30 p.m. C.T. both days. Primary Closure Period 11/13/26 from 11:00 AM to 11:30 PM and 11/14/26 from 11:00 AM to 11:30 PM Alternate Dates",
